msgctxt ""
"Translators, feel free to add yourself in the text below, asking for a "
"postcard ;-), also feel free to add a section saying <h2>Translators</h2>. "
"Kind regards, and thanks for your work - Jesper."
msgid ""
"<h1>Regular Expression Editor</h1><p>What you are currently looking at is an "
"editor for <i>Regular Expressions</i>.</p><p>The upper part in the middle is "
"the editing area, the lower part is a verification window where you can try "
"your regular expressions right away. The row of buttons is the editing "
"actions. This is actually very similar to common drawing programs. Select an "
"editing tool to start editing your regular expression, and press the mouse "
"button in the editing area where you want this item inserted.</p><p>For a "
"more detailed description of this editor see the <a href=\"doc://\">info "
"pages</a></p><h2>What is a regular expression?</h2>If you do not know what a "
"regular expression is, then it might be a good idea to read <a href=\"doc://"
"whatIsARegExp\">the introduction to regular expressions</a>.<br />"
msgstr ""
"<h1>नियमित अभिव्यक्ति सम्पादक</h1><p>तपाईँले <i>नियमित अभिव्यक्ति</i> का लागि के हेर्दै "
"हुनुहुन्छ ।</p><p>माथिल्लो मध्य क्षेत्र सम्पादन क्षेत्र हो । तल्लो क्षेत्र रूजू क्षेत्र हो जाहाँ "
"तपाईँले नियमित अभिव्यक्ति प्रयास गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ । बटनको पङ्क्ति सम्पादन कार्य हो । यो "
"वास्तवैमा साझा रेखाचित्र कार्यक्रम जस्तै हो । तपाईँको नियमित अभिव्यक्ति सम्पादन सुरु गर्न "
"सम्पादन उपकरण चयन गर्नुहोस् र तपाईँले त्यो वस्तु घुसाउन चाहनु भएको सम्पादन क्षेत्रमा माउस "
"बटन थिच्नुहोस् ।</p><p>यो सम्पादकका बारेमा बढी जानकारीका लागि <a href=\"doc://"
"\">जानकारी पृष्ठ</a> हेर्नुहोस् ।</p><h2>नियमित अभिव्यक्ति के हो ?</h2>यदि तपाईँलाई "
"नियमित अभिव्यक्ति के हो भनेर थाहा छैन भने <a href=\"doc://whatIsARegExp\">नियमित "
"अभिव्यक्तिको परिचय</a> पढ्नु राम्रो विचार हुन सक्छ ।<p>"

#: infopage.cpp:55
msgid ""
"<h2>Send the author an electronic postcard</h2>I don't get any money for "
"working on KRegExpEditor, I therefore appreciate it very much when users "
"tell me what they think about my work. I would therefore be very happy if "
"you <a href=\"mailto:blackie@kde.org?subject=KRegExpEditor\">sent me a short "
"mail</a>, telling me that you use my regular expression editor.<h2>Author</"
"h2><a href=\"http://www.blackie.dk/\">Jesper K. Pedersen</a> &lt;<a href="
"\"mailto:blackie@kde.org\">blackie@kde.org</a>&gt;"
msgstr ""
"<h2>लेखकलाई विद्युतिय पोस्टकार्ड पठाउनुहोस्</h2>मैले KRegExp सम्पादकमा काम गर्दा कुनै पैसा "
"पाउदिन, त्यसैले प्रयोगकर्ताले मेरो बारेमा के सोच्दछन् भन्ने कुरामा म आभारी हुन्छ । यदि तपाईँले "
"<a href=\"mailto:blackie@kde.org?subject=KRegExpEditor\"> मा तपाईँले मेरो "
"नियमित अभिव्यक्ति सम्पादक प्रयोग गर्छु भनेर </a>, मलाई पत्र पठाउनु भएमा म खुसि हुन्छु "
"।<h2>लेखक</h2><a href=\"http://www.blackie.dk/\">जेस्पेर के. पिडरसेन</a> lt;<a "
"href=\"mailto:blackie@kde.org\">blackie@kde.org</a>&gt;"

#: kregexpeditorgui.cpp:77
msgid "Regular Expression Editor"
msgstr "नियमित अभिव्यक्ति सम्पादक"

#: kregexpeditorprivate.cpp:75
msgid ""
"In this window you will find predefined regular expressions. Both regular "
"expressions you have developed and saved, and regular expressions shipped "
"with the system."
msgstr ""
"यो सञ्झ्यालमा तपाईँले पूर्व परिभाषित नियमित अभिव्यक्ति फेला पार्नुहुनेछ । तपाईँले विकास गर्नु "
"भएको र बचत गर्नु भएको दुबै नियमित अभिव्यक्तिहरू प्रणालीसँग पठाइन्छ ।"

#: kregexpeditorprivate.cpp:83
msgid ""
"In this window you will develop your regular expressions. Select one of the "
"actions from the action buttons above, and click the mouse in this window to "
"insert the given action."
msgstr ""
"यो सञ्झ्यालमा तपाईँले नियमित अभिव्यक्ति विकास गर्नुहुन्छ । माथिको कार्य बटनबाट एउटा कुनै "
"कार्य चयन गर्नुहोस् र दिइएको कार्य घुसाउन यो सञ्झ्यालमा माउस क्लिक गर्नुहोस् ।"

#: kregexpeditorprivate.cpp:91
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Type in some text in this window, and see what the regular expression you "
#| "have developed matches.<p>Each second match will be colored in red and "
#| "each other match will be colored blue, simply so you can distinguish them "
#| "from each other.<p>If you select part of the regular expression in the "
#| "editor window, then this part will be highlighted - This allows you to "
#| "<i>debug</i> your regular expressions"
msgid ""
"<p>Type in some text in this window, and see what the regular expression you "
"have developed matches.</p><p>Each second match will be colored in red and "
"each other match will be colored blue, simply so you can distinguish them "
"from each other.</p><p>If you select part of the regular expression in the "
"editor window, then this part will be highlighted - This allows you to "
"<i>debug</i> your regular expressions</p>"
msgstr ""
"यो सझ्यालमा केही पाठ टाइप गर्नुहोस् र तपाईँले विकास गर्नु भएको मिल्दो नियमित अभिव्यक्ति "
"हेर्नुहोस् । <p>प्रत्येक मिल्दो दोस्रोलाई रातो रङ दिइन्छ र अरूलाई निलो, त्यसैले तपाईँले "
"सजिलैसँग छुट्याउन सक्नुहुन्छ ।<p> यदि तपाईँले सम्पादक सञ्झ्यालमा नियमित अभिव्यक्तिको भाग "
"चयन गर्नुभएमा यो भाग हाइलाइट गरिन्छ - यसले तपाईँलाई नियमित अभिव्यक्ति <i>डिबग</i> "
"गर्न अनुमति दिन्छ ।"

